    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia alikuwa na umri wa miaka minane alipoanza kutawala; alitawala miaka thelathini na mmoja huko Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitenda mema mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. Alifuata njia zake Daudi babu yake, na kushika amri za Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa dhati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika mwaka wa nne wa utawala wake, mfalme Yosia, akiwa bado kijana, alianza kumwabudu Mungu wa Daudi, baba yake. Baadaye alipokuwa na umri wa miaka kumi na miwili alianza kuisafisha Yuda na Yerusalemu kwa kuharibu mahali pa kuabudia miungu mingine, sanamu za Ashera, na sanamu nyinginezo za kuchonga na za kusubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wake walizibomoa madhabahu za ibada za Mabaali mbele yake na alizikatakata madhabahu za kufukizia ubani zilizoinuliwa juu ya madhabahu hizo; pia alizipondaponda sanamu za Ashera na nyinginezo za kuchonga na za kusubu; alizifanya kuwa mavumbi, nayo mavumbi akayamwaga juu ya makaburi ya wale ambao hapo awali walizitolea sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aidha, aliiteketeza mifupa ya makuhani wa miungu hiyo kwenye madhabahu zao, hivyo akatakasa Yuda na Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alifanya vivyo hivyo katika miji ya Manase, Efraimu, Simeoni mpaka Naftali na kwenye magofu yaliyokuwa kandokando ya miji hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alizibomoa madhabahu na kupondaponda Maashera na sanamu za kuchongwa zikawa mavumbi. Kadhalika alizikatakata madhabahu za kufukizia ubani katika nchi yote ya Israeli. Hatimaye alirudi Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika mwaka wa kumi na nane wa utawala wake, wakati ambapo alikuwa amekwisha takasa nchi na nyumba, alituma watu watatu: Shafani mwana wa Azalia, Maaseya gavana wa mji na Yoa mwana wa Yoahazi, Katibu, ili waende kuirekebisha nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walimwendea Hilkia, kuhani mkuu, wakamkabidhi fedha zilizokuwa zimeletwa katika nyumba ya Mungu ambazo zilikusanywa na Walawi wangojamlango, kutoka Manase, Efraimu na kutoka pande nyingine zote za Israeli, nchi yote ya Yuda na Benyamini, na pia kutoka kwa wenyeji wa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zilikabidhiwa wale mafundi waliosimamia marekebisho ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu; na mafundi waliofanya kazi katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu walizitoa ili kutengeneza na kurekebisha nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waliwapatia maseremala na wajenzi kwa ajili ya kununulia mawe yaliyochongwa, mbao za kuunganishia na mihimili ya kutumia katika kurekebisha yale majengo ambayo wafalme wa Yuda waliyaacha yakabomokabomoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu hao waliifanya kazi hiyo kwa uaminifu, wakiwa chini ya uongozi wa Walawi Yahathi na Obadia, chini ya wana wa Merari na Zekaria na Meshulamu na chini ya wazawa wa Kohathi. Walawi wote waliokuwa na ujuzi sana katika upigaji wa vyombo vya muziki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waliwasimamia wachukuzi wa mizigo na kuwaongoza wote waliofanya kazi mbalimbali; baadhi ya Walawi walikuwa waandishi, maofisa na hata walinda mlango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati walipokuwa wanashughulika na utoaji wa fedha zilizokuwa zimeletwa katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, kuhani Hilkia alipata Kitabu cha Sheria ya Mwenyezi-Mungu iliyotolewa kwa mkono wa Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Hilkia alimwambia Shafani mwandishi, “Nimekipata Kitabu cha Sheria katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu.” Halafu Hilkia akampatia Shafani kitabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Shafani akampelekea mfalme na kumpasha habari, akisema, “Yote watumishi wako waliyokabidhiwa wanayafanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wametoa fedha zilizopatikana katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, halafu wamezikabidhi kwa wasimamizi na mafundi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Katibu Shafani akamwambia mfalme, “Kuhani Hilkia amenipa kitabu.” Naye Shafani akakisoma mbele ya mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme aliposikia maneno ya sheria alirarua mavazi yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo alipomwamuru Hilkia, Ahikamu mwana wa Shafani, Abdoni mwana wa Mika, katibu Shafani na Asaya, mtumishi wa mfalme, akisema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nendeni mkatafute shauri kutoka kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa niaba yangu na watu ambao wamebaki katika Israeli na Yuda, kuhusu maneno yaliyomo katika kitabu kilichopatikana. Kwa sababu ghadhabu ya Mwenyezi-Mungu imetuangukia, maana babu zetu hawakushika neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu, wala kufanya yaliyoandikwa humo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo Hilkia pamoja na wale wengine mfalme aliowatuma",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiebrania hakina aliowatuma.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " walimwendea nabii Hulda, mkewe Shalumu, mwana wa Tokathi, mwana wa Hasra, mtunza mavazi yaliyotumika hekaluni (alikuwa anaishi Yerusalemu katika mtaa wa pili); nao walizungumza naye juu ya mambo yaliyotokea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi akawaambia, “Hivi ndivyo anavyosema Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli: Mwambie huyo aliyewatuma kwangu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu anasema hivi, ‘Tazama nitaleta uovu juu ya Yerusalemu na juu ya wakazi wake, laana zote zilizoandikwa katika kitabu kilichosomwa mbele ya mfalme wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa sababu wameniacha mimi na kufukizia miungu mingine ubani ili wanikasirishe sana kwa kazi zote za mikono yao, basi ghadhabu yangu itamwagika juu ya mahali hapa wala haitatulizwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kumhusu mfalme wa Yuda, aliyewatuma kutafuta shauri la Mwenyezi-Mungu mwambie kwamba, hivi ndivyo anavyosema Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli juu ya maneno uliyoyasikia: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kuwa umetubu na kunyenyekea mbele yangu, hata umerarua mavazi yako na kulia uliposikia maneno yangu dhidi ya mahali hapa, na dhidi ya wakazi wake, na umejinyenyekesha mbele yangu, nami pia nimekusikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adhabu ambayo nitailetea Yerusalemu, sitaileta wakati wa uhai wako. Utawala wako utakuwa wa amani.’” Basi, wajumbe wakamletea mfalme Yosia habari hizi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
